 </div>
 </div>
 <div id="notif-item-2" class="interactive-card-item" style="padding: 10px;">
 <div style="flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;">
 <span class="interactive-card-text" style="font-weight: 700; color: #F5F2EB;">Schedule Buffer Optimization</span>
 <span class="legend-text" style="color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.65);">All tasks paced with 10m rest buffers. Evening free after 7:00 PM.</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
